## Step 6: Database Updates (If Applicable)

If you're adding authentication, you'll need user management:

```sql
-- Create users table
CREATE TABLE users (
  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
  password_hash VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
  name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
