### Required Secrets

Define required secrets in initialization:

```javascript
await initializeSecretsManager({
  provider: 'aws',
  required: [
    'JWT_SECRET',
    'SESSION_SECRET',
    'DATABASE_URL',
    'API_KEY'
  ]
});
```

Application will fail to start if any required secret is missing.

