### 5. ❌ PII Data Exposure

**Issue:**
Email addresses (PII) are exposed without authentication.

**GDPR/Privacy Implications:**
- Violates data minimization principle
- No consent for data access
- No purpose limitation
- Potential fines up to €20M or 4% of revenue

**Fix:**
```javascript
app.get('/api/users', authenticateToken, (req, res) => {
  const users = getUsersFromDB();

  // Filter data based on user role
  const sanitizedUsers = users.map(user => {
    // Only return email if user is admin or viewing own profile
    if (req.user.role === 'admin' || req.user.id === user.id) {
      return user;
    }
    // Remove sensitive data for others
    const { email, phone, ...publicData } = user;
    return publicData;
  });

  res.json(sanitizedUsers);
});
```

