## 🚨 Common Vulnerability Patterns

### ❌ WRONG
```javascript
// No authentication
app.get('/users', (req, res) => {
  res.json(users);
});

// SQL injection vulnerable
app.get('/users/:id', (req, res) => {
  db.query(`SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ${req.params.id}`);
});

// No validation
app.post('/users', (req, res) => {
  const user = req.body; // Direct use
  db.save(user);
});
```

### ✅ CORRECT
