### A07: Identification and Authentication Failures
**Fix:** Strong password policies, MFA, secure session management
```javascript
// Strong password validation
body('password')
  .isLength({ min: 12 })
  .matches(/^(?=.*[a-z])(?=.*[A-Z])(?=.*\d)(?=.*[@$!%*?&])/)
